<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>重置密码</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css?v=20260809a">
  <style>
    .auth-page { max-width: 22rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
    .auth-page h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .auth-page .hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .auth-page label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.85rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .auth-page input { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.35rem; padding: 0.55rem 0.65rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; font: inherit; color: var(--text); background: var(--bg); }
    .auth-page button { width: 100%; margin-top: 0.5rem; padding: 0.65rem; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--accent); color: #fff; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
    .auth-alert { padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: #fdecea; color: #b71c1c; }
    .auth-links { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="auth-page">
    <h1>设置新密码</h1>
    <p class="hint">重置成功后，所有设备上的登录都会失效，需要用新密码重新登录。</p>

    <% if (error) { %><div class="auth-alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>

    <form method="post" action="/reset-password" autocomplete="on">
      <input type="hidden" name="token" value="<%= token %>">
      <label>
        新密码
        <input type="password" name="password" required minlength="8" placeholder="至少 8 位" autocomplete="new-password">
      </label>
      <label>
        确认新密码
        <input type="password" name="password2" required minlength="8" placeholder="再输入一次" autocomplete="new-password">
      </label>
      <button type="submit">重置密码</button>
    </form>

    <div class="auth-links"><a href="/login">返回登录</a></div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
